>> title: Hotteok
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: korean, yeast, brown sugar, dessert, skillet
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: hoddeok, ho dduk, Korean sweet pancake, brown sugar pancake
>> servings: 8
>> time: 2 hr 30 min

Whisk @warm whole milk{1%cup}(240 mL), @instant yeast{1 1/2%tsp}(5 g), and @sugar{1%Tbsp}(12 g).

Knead @&(~1)yeast milk{}, @all-purpose flour{2%cup}(260 g), @glutinous rice flour{1/4%cup}(40 g), and @fine sea salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g) into a sticky dough.

Prove @&(~1)dough{} covered ~{1 1/2%hr}, until doubled.

Stir @dark brown sugar{1/2%cup}(100 g), @ground cinnamon{1%tsp}(3 g), and @chopped walnuts{1/4%cup}(30 g) together.

>> step: seal the filling inside 8 dough balls
Seal @&(~1)filling{} inside @&(~2)dough{}, pinched into 8 balls.

>> step: press flat in oil, fry 2 min per side
Fry @&(~1)filled dough{} in @vegetable oil{3%Tbsp}(45 mL), pressing flat, ~{2%min} per side.
